  "details": "In recent VRC updates (up to now), if you wearing a PC avatar with Imposter generated for it, it will cause Android players to unable to see your movements, aka for them you will be standing in one place.\n\n1)Join instance with Android users wearing Android compatible avatar.\n\n2)Stand in any place near android user, so he(she) can see you.\n\n3)Change avatar to PC only with Imposter generated for it and \"Show Imposter as Fallback\" enabled.\n\n4)Move to a different place of that you're standing.\n\n5)Ask Android user if you moved at all.\n\nThis doesn't happen if Imposter isn't generated(deleted) or \"Show Imposter as Fallback\" is disabled.",
